{"id":"df9f71df8fe0440f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/082_显示演算_Display_Calculus.md","title":"082 显示演算 Display Calculus","display":"082_显示演算_Display_Calculus","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号与公式构造子\">1. 符号与公式构造子</h1>\n<p>令命题变元集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_D\">\\(Frm_D\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_D\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_D\">\\(A\\in Frm_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_D\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_D\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_D\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_D\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_D\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_D\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_D\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"2.-变量与替换\">2. 变量与替换</h1>\n<p>变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV:Frm_D\\to\\mathcal P(Prop)\">\\(PV:Frm_D\\to\\mathcal P(Prop)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\nPV(neg(A))=PV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\nPV(neg(A))=PV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_D=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_D=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_D\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_D\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^D\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^D\\)</span> 是公式字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-显示结构\">3. 显示结构</h1>\n<p>结构构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"frm,\\quad one,\\quad prod,\\quad lres,\\quad rres.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[frm,\\quad one,\\quad prod,\\quad lres,\\quad rres.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Str_D\">\\(Str_D\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_D\">\\(A\\in Frm_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"frm(A)\\in Str_D\">\\(frm(A)\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"one\\in Str_D\">\\(one\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y\\in Str_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"prod(X,Y)\\in Str_D\">\\(prod(X,Y)\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y\\in Str_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"lres(X,Y)\\in Str_D\">\\(lres(X,Y)\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y\\in Str_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rres(X,Y)\\in Str_D\">\\(rres(X,Y)\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>结构替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubStr}_D:Str_D\\times Sub_D\\to Str_D\">\\(\\operatorname{SubStr}_D:Str_D\\times Sub_D\\to Str_D\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"frm(A)\\widehat\\sigma=frm(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\qquad one\\widehat\\sigma=one,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[frm(A)\\widehat\\sigma=frm(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\qquad one\\widehat\\sigma=one,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"prod(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=prod(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[prod(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=prod(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"lres(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=lres(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma),\n\\qquad\nrres(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=rres(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[lres(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=lres(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma),\n\\qquad\nrres(X,Y)\\widehat\\sigma=rres(X\\widehat\\sigma,Y\\widehat\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-显示相继式与结构上下文\">4. 显示相继式与结构上下文</h1>\n<p>显示相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_D=Str_D\\times Str_D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_D=Str_D\\times Str_D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\Rightarrow Y\">\\(X\\Rightarrow Y\\)</span>。单洞结构上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ctx_D\">\\(Ctx_D\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>洞 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hole\\in Ctx_D\">\\(hole\\in Ctx_D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in Ctx_D\">\\(C\\in Ctx_D\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in Str_D\">\\(X\\in Str_D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"prod(C,X)\">\\(prod(C,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"prod(X,C)\">\\(prod(X,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"lres(C,X)\">\\(lres(C,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"lres(X,C)\">\\(lres(X,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rres(C,X)\">\\(rres(C,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rres(X,C)\">\\(rres(X,C)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ctx_D\">\\(Ctx_D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填洞函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug_D:Ctx_D\\times Str_D\\to Str_D\">\\(Plug_D:Ctx_D\\times Str_D\\to Str_D\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_D(hole,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_D(hole,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_D(prod(C,Y),X)=prod(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(prod(Y,C),X)=prod(Y,Plug_D(C,X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_D(prod(C,Y),X)=prod(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(prod(Y,C),X)=prod(Y,Plug_D(C,X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_D(lres(C,Y),X)=lres(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(lres(Y,C),X)=lres(Y,Plug_D(C,X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_D(lres(C,Y),X)=lres(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(lres(Y,C),X)=lres(Y,Plug_D(C,X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_D(rres(C,Y),X)=rres(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(rres(Y,C),X)=rres(Y,Plug_D(C,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_D(rres(C,Y),X)=rres(Plug_D(C,X),Y),\n\\quad\nPlug_D(rres(Y,C),X)=rres(Y,Plug_D(C,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义结构同余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_D\">\\(\\equiv_D\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Str_D\">\\(Str_D\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的最小等价关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"frm(A)\\equiv_D frm(A)\">\\(frm(A)\\equiv_D frm(A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"one\\equiv_D one\">\\(one\\equiv_D one\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0\\equiv_D X_1\">\\(X_0\\equiv_D X_1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\equiv_D Y_1\">\\(Y_0\\equiv_D Y_1\\)</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\{prod,lres,rres\\}\">\\(K\\in\\{prod,lres,rres\\}\\)</span>，</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K(X_0,Y_0)\\equiv_D K(X_1,Y_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K(X_0,Y_0)\\equiv_D K(X_1,Y_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目不额外商去结合律、交换律或单位律，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_D\">\\(\\equiv_D\\)</span> 恰是有限构造树同余。相继式结构同余为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\equiv_{Seq}^{D}(X&#39;\\Rightarrow Y&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\equiv_D X&#39;\\land Y\\equiv_D Y&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\equiv_{Seq}^{D}(X&#39;\\Rightarrow Y&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nX\\equiv_D X&#39;\\land Y\\equiv_D Y&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Path_D=\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(Path_D=\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的路径、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i)^\\frown p\">\\((i)^\\frown p\\)</span> 为单元素列与路径的连接。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Pos_D:Str_D\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Path_D),\\qquad\nPos_D(frm(A))=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\quad Pos_D(one)=\\{\\epsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Pos_D:Str_D\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Path_D),\\qquad\nPos_D(frm(A))=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\quad Pos_D(one)=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Pos_D(K(X_0,X_1))=\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(0)^\\frown p:p\\in Pos_D(X_0)\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)^\\frown p:p\\in Pos_D(X_1)\\},\\quad K\\in\\{prod,lres,rres\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Pos_D(K(X_0,X_1))=\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(0)^\\frown p:p\\in Pos_D(X_0)\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)^\\frown p:p\\in Pos_D(X_1)\\},\\quad K\\in\\{prod,lres,rres\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子结构是偏函数，域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(X,p):X\\in Str_D,\\ p\\in Pos_D(X)\\}\">\\(\\{(X,p):X\\in Str_D,\\ p\\in Pos_D(X)\\}\\)</span>；在该域上递归为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X|_\\epsilon=X,\\qquad\nK(X_0,X_1)|_{(i)^\\frown p}=X_i|_p\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ p\\in Pos_D(X_i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X|_\\epsilon=X,\\qquad\nK(X_0,X_1)|_{(i)^\\frown p}=X_i|_p\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ p\\in Pos_D(X_i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可显示位置谓词的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Str_D\\times Path_D\\times Frm_D\">\\(Str_D\\times Path_D\\times Frm_D\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D}(X,p,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in Pos_D(X)\\land X|_p=frm(A)\n\\land\\exists C\\in Ctx_D\\ X=Plug_D(C,frm(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D}(X,p,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in Pos_D(X)\\land X|_p=frm(A)\n\\land\\exists C\\in Ctx_D\\ X=Plug_D(C,frm(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子结构调用按位置守卫解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"frm(A)\">\\(frm(A)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"one\">\\(one\\)</span> 都没有非根位置，域外路径不能通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Displayable_D\">\\(Displayable_D\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-显示公设关系\">5. 显示公设关系</h1>\n<p>显示公设关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Disp_D\\subseteq Seq_D\\times Seq_D\">\\(Disp_D\\subseteq Seq_D\\times Seq_D\\)</span> 是下列关系的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z))\\in Disp_D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z))\\in Disp_D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z)\\in Disp_D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z)\\in Disp_D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z))\\in Disp_D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z))\\in Disp_D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z)\\in Disp_D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z)\\in Disp_D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in Str_D\\)</span>。这些关系是显示演算区别于普通相继式演算的结构重排机制。</p>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Disp_D\">\\(Disp_D\\)</span> 由所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in Str_D\\)</span> 的下列四类有向对组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nDisp_D=\\{&amp;(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z)),\\\\\n&amp;(X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z),\\\\\n&amp;(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z)),\\\\\n&amp;(Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z):\nX,Y,Z\\in Str_D\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nDisp_D=\\{&amp;(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z)),\\\\\n&amp;(X\\Rightarrow lres(Y,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z),\\\\\n&amp;(prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z,\\ Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z)),\\\\\n&amp;(Y\\Rightarrow rres(X,Z),\\ prod(X,Y)\\Rightarrow Z):\nX,Y,Z\\in Str_D\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限显示变换证书</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DispCert}_{D}(S,T,c)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nc:n+1\\to Seq_D\n\\land c(0)=S\n\\land c(n)=T\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ (c(i),c(i+1))\\in Disp_D\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DispCert}_{D}(S,T,c)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nc:n+1\\to Seq_D\n\\land c(0)=S\n\\land c(n)=T\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ (c(i),c(i+1))\\in Disp_D\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义可达显示关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Disp_D^{*}\n=\n\\{(S,T):\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{DispCert}_{D}(S,T,c)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Disp_D^{*}\n=\n\\{(S,T):\\exists c\\ \\operatorname{DispCert}_{D}(S,T,c)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-初始项与逻辑规则\">6. 初始项与逻辑规则</h1>\n<p>初始相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_D=\\{frm(A)\\Rightarrow frm(A):A\\in Frm_D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_D=\\{frm(A)\\Rightarrow frm(A):A\\in Frm_D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逻辑规则关系包含：</p>\n<p>以下每个逻辑规则集合均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Seq_D^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_D\">\\(Seq_D^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_D\\)</span> 的子集；集合式中的自由参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_D\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_D\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in Str_D\">\\(X,Y\\in Str_D\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge R}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow frm(A),X\\Rightarrow frm(B)),X\\Rightarrow frm(and(A,B)))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge R}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow frm(A),X\\Rightarrow frm(B)),X\\Rightarrow frm(and(A,B)))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(frm(A),frm(B))\\Rightarrow X),\\ frm(and(A,B))\\Rightarrow X)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge L}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(frm(A),frm(B))\\Rightarrow X),\\ frm(and(A,B))\\Rightarrow X)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L}^D\n=\n\\{((frm(A)\\Rightarrow X,frm(B)\\Rightarrow X),frm(or(A,B))\\Rightarrow X)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee L}^D\n=\n\\{((frm(A)\\Rightarrow X,frm(B)\\Rightarrow X),frm(or(A,B))\\Rightarrow X)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow prod(frm(A),frm(B))),X\\Rightarrow frm(or(A,B)))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow prod(frm(A),frm(B))),X\\Rightarrow frm(or(A,B)))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to R}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(X,frm(A))\\Rightarrow frm(B)),X\\Rightarrow frm(imp(A,B)))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to R}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(X,frm(A))\\Rightarrow frm(B)),X\\Rightarrow frm(imp(A,B)))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow frm(A),frm(B)\\Rightarrow Y),prod(frm(imp(A,B)),X)\\Rightarrow Y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to L}^D\n=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow frm(A),frm(B)\\Rightarrow Y),prod(frm(imp(A,B)),X)\\Rightarrow Y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定左右规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg R}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(X,frm(A))\\Rightarrow one),\\ X\\Rightarrow frm(neg(A)))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg R}^D\n=\n\\{((prod(X,frm(A))\\Rightarrow one),\\ X\\Rightarrow frm(neg(A)))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg L}^D\n=\n\\{((one\\Rightarrow prod(frm(A),Y)),\\ frm(neg(A))\\Rightarrow Y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg L}^D\n=\n\\{((one\\Rightarrow prod(frm(A),Y)),\\ frm(neg(A))\\Rightarrow Y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示公设注入有限前提列关系的统一编码为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Disp}^{D}\n=\n\\{((S),T):S,T\\in Seq_D\\land(S,T)\\in Disp_D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Disp}^{D}\n=\n\\{((S),T):S,T\\in Seq_D\\land(S,T)\\in Disp_D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{base}^{D}=Rule_{Disp}^{D}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\neg L}^D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{base}^{D}=Rule_{Disp}^{D}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^D\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg R}^D\\cup Rule_{\\neg L}^D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构同余规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\equiv}^{D}\n=\n\\{((S),T):S,T\\in Seq_D\\land S\\equiv_{Seq}^{D}T\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\equiv}^{D}\n=\n\\{((S),T):S,T\\in Seq_D\\land S\\equiv_{Seq}^{D}T\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并把总规则关系更新为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_D=Rule_{base}^{D}\\cup Rule_{\\equiv}^{D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_D=Rule_{base}^{D}\\cup Rule_{\\equiv}^{D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-显示推导树\">7. 显示推导树</h1>\n<p>显示推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}\\)</span> 刻画。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在有限树域上，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\">\\(Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\\)</span>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\">\\(e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\\)</span> 为严格递增的唯一双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|\">\\(k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n):k_n\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\lambda)\">\\(Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n):k_n\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\lambda)\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(e_n(i))\">\\(\\lambda(e_n(i))\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N\\land\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Init_D)\n\\lor(Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_D\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N\\land\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Init_D)\n\\lor(Prem_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_D\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>实际前提列覆盖全部不同子节点；一元、二元规则按该列的真实长度核验，不能重复一个节点冒充两个分支。各投影和该前提列函数仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}\\)</span> 的域上调用。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_D X\\Rightarrow Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=X\\Rightarrow Y\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_D X\\Rightarrow Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=X\\Rightarrow Y\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{D}=\\{X\\Rightarrow Y\\in Seq_D:\\vdash_D X\\Rightarrow Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{D}=\\{X\\Rightarrow Y\\in Seq_D:\\vdash_D X\\Rightarrow Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统以显示结构、结构上下文和显示公设关系为核心，规则先通过显示公设把目标公式暴露到主位置再应用逻辑规则；它不同于普通相继式演算的固定左右上下文。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_D\n=\n(Str_D,Ctx_D,Plug_D,\\equiv_D,Path_D,\nPos_D,\n\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D},Disp_D,Disp_D^{*},\nRule_D,\\operatorname{Der}_{D},\\mathsf{Cn}_{D}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_D\n=\n(Str_D,Ctx_D,Plug_D,\\equiv_D,Path_D,\nPos_D,\n\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D},Disp_D,Disp_D^{*},\nRule_D,\\operatorname{Der}_{D},\\mathsf{Cn}_{D}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DisplayCalculus}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_D,\nPV,\nSub_D,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nStr_D,\n\\operatorname{SubStr}_D,\nCtx_D,\nPlug_D,\n\\equiv_D,\n\\equiv_{Seq}^{D},\nPath_D,\nPos_D,\n\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D},\nSeq_D,\nDisp_D,\n\\operatorname{DispCert}_{D},\nDisp_D^{*},\nRule_{Disp}^{D},\nInit_D,\nRule_{\\wedge R}^D,\nRule_{\\wedge L}^D,\nRule_{\\vee R}^D,\nRule_{\\vee L}^D,\nRule_{\\to R}^D,\nRule_{\\to L}^D,\nRule_{\\neg R}^D,\nRule_{\\neg L}^D,\nRule_{\\equiv}^{D},\nRule_{base}^{D},\nRule_D,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{D},\nPrem_{D},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{D},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D},\n\\vdash_D,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{D},\n\\Delta_D\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DisplayCalculus}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_D,\nPV,\nSub_D,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nStr_D,\n\\operatorname{SubStr}_D,\nCtx_D,\nPlug_D,\n\\equiv_D,\n\\equiv_{Seq}^{D},\nPath_D,\nPos_D,\n\\operatorname{Displayable}_{D},\nSeq_D,\nDisp_D,\n\\operatorname{DispCert}_{D},\nDisp_D^{*},\nRule_{Disp}^{D},\nInit_D,\nRule_{\\wedge R}^D,\nRule_{\\wedge L}^D,\nRule_{\\vee R}^D,\nRule_{\\vee L}^D,\nRule_{\\to R}^D,\nRule_{\\to L}^D,\nRule_{\\neg R}^D,\nRule_{\\neg L}^D,\nRule_{\\equiv}^{D},\nRule_{base}^{D},\nRule_D,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{D},\nPrem_{D},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{D},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{D},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{D},\n\\vdash_D,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{D},\n\\Delta_D\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含显示结构、显示公设、逻辑规则和有限显示推导树；不含外部模型论构造、评价关系或割消去定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号与公式构造子","text":"1. 符号与公式构造子","level":1},{"id":"2.-变量与替换","text":"2. 变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-显示结构","text":"3. 显示结构","level":1},{"id":"4.-显示相继式与结构上下文","text":"4. 显示相继式与结构上下文","level":1},{"id":"5.-显示公设关系","text":"5. 显示公设关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-初始项与逻辑规则","text":"6. 初始项与逻辑规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-显示推导树","text":"7. 显示推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_D","display":false},{"tex":"PV:Frm_D\\to\\mathcal P(Prop)","display":false},{"tex":"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\nPV(neg(A))=PV(A),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_D=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_D\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in S